Your own firewall rules: files NAME.nft in this folder are added to the
rules in /etc/nftables.conf. System updates keep this folder.

Example, /etc/nftables.d/ssh.nft (lets others connect to an SSH server):

    add rule inet my-firewall input tcp dport 22 accept

Load the rules again (as root): /etc/init.d/S35firewall restart
